{
  "name": "ivey-edge",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 95.409,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "This man won seven point seven million pounds at a London casino, without touching the cards that won it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.773,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "94b7f46e901f"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "This game is pure chance, and the house keeps about a one percent edge.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.106,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "00c548dac03a"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But the pattern on these cards sat less than a millimeter off center.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.591,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "00c548dac03a"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So one long edge looked slightly different from the other.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.462,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "00c548dac03a"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Alone, that was useless, because every card had the same flaw.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.245,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "00c548dac03a"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Phil Ivey needed the good cards facing one way, and the rest facing the other.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.177,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "00c548dac03a"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But at this table, only the dealer touches the cards.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.563,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "fef76d6e530c"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So his partner asked her for a small favor.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.828,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "fef76d6e530c"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Turn the good ones this way, and the bad ones that way.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.316,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "fef76d6e530c"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "To change the luck, she said.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.339,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "fef76d6e530c"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Casinos hear that all the time.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.268,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "fef76d6e530c"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.5,
      "text": "The dealer had no idea why.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.387,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "fef76d6e530c"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then Ivey said he had won with those cards, and wanted to keep them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.008,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "574acb4f2a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The casino agreed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.904,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "574acb4f2a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A shuffling machine mixed them without turning a single one.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.102,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "574acb4f2a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now the back of the next card gave it away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.253,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "574acb4f2a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "One percent for the house could become six and a half for him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.203,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "574acb4f2a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His bets had started as low as four thousand pounds.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.585,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cea9f4a14b99"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now they hit one hundred and fifty thousand, the casino's limit.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.022,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cea9f4a14b99"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In one stretch, he read the next card right seventeen times out of nineteen.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.775,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cea9f4a14b99"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In two days, he was up seven point seven million pounds.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.314,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cea9f4a14b99"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That same year, the pair took an American casino for nine point six million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.334,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cea9f4a14b99"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.85,
      "text": "That casino paid.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.177,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cea9f4a14b99"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "London did not.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.371,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Nine days later, they told him the game was compromised.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.42,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They handed back his one million pound stake, and nothing else.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.013,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Ivey sued, admitted everything, and insisted it was not cheating.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.848,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The judge believed he meant it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.057,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Five years later, it reached the Supreme Court.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.034,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "All five justices ruled against him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.617,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He had fixed the deck, they said, using the dealer as his hands.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.836,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "Clever, skillful, and still cheating.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.78,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c2442b249c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In America, a judge found no fraud, but ordered ten point one million dollars back.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.498,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "bdf5b701754e"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "They later settled, terms undisclosed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.021,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "bdf5b701754e"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The flaw was in their own deck.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.853,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "0bfbcf3aa5df"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "You own that casino.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.26,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "0bfbcf3aa5df"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Do you pay him?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ivey-edge/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.069,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "22b04ba577e2"
    }
  ]
}
